Some of Vaultr's mods began as forks of, or carry forward code and action lists from, mods shipped with the Herdr app:
- mods/ob-agents (from Herdr's shipped agents mod)
- mods/ob-sessions (git.js and parts of main.js carried over from Herdr's shipped spaces mod)
- mods/ob-switcher/commands.js (action names and command tables derived from Herdr's shipped palette frame mod)

